---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About PRC"
  kicker="About PRC"
  heading="A Records Readiness company"
  lede="Our purpose is preparedness. Our mission is records readiness. Our method is building dependable records systems."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        Paula Records Custodian LLC (PRC) is not defined by scanning, filing, cloud storage,
        binders, software, artificial intelligence, or automation. Those are tools PRC may use.
        The value PRC delivers is <strong>preparedness through dependable records systems</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        PRC helps people, families, businesses, nonprofits, and organizations identify, organize,
        preserve, track, retrieve, and connect the records that matter — so they are better prepared
        for opportunities, responsibilities, life transitions, business transitions, emergencies,
        and requests for proof.
      </p>

      <h2>Why records readiness</h2>
      <p>
        People often do not realize the value of a record until they need it. A funding application,
        an audit, an insurance claim, a dispute, a new job, a new apartment, the loss of a loved one —
        each of these is a moment when life asks for proof. PRC exists to help people prepare
        <em>before</em> that moment arrives.
      </p>

      <h2>What makes PRC different</h2>
      <ul class="list-check">
        <li>We deliver systems, not storage. A folder is not the system.</li>
        <li>We connect records to the charges, payments, decisions, and events they support.</li>
        <li>We plan for continuity — so operations survive the loss of a person, device, system, or office.</li>
        <li>We keep humans in the loop for conclusions, sensitive records, and client-facing decisions.</li>
        <li>We respect professional boundaries — see our <a href="/service-boundaries">Service Boundaries</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our signature statements</h2>
      <div class="statements" style="margin-top:1rem;">
        <div class="statement">Before there is a dispute, there should be a record.</div>
        <div class="statement">PRC exists to help people prepare before life asks for proof.</div>
        <div class="statement">Organize for today. Prepare for tomorrow. Preserve for the future.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
